#. module: ff_batch_manufacturing
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ff_batch_manufacturing
msgid ""
"\n"
"Flous Flow Batch Manufacturing\n"
"==============================\n"
"\n"
"Create one batch sheet containing multiple manufacturing products. Every "
"line\n"
"uses its own native Odoo Manufacturing Order, so components can be reviewed "
"and\n"
"customized independently without changing the master BoM. Confirm & "
"Manufacture\n"
"executes eligible simple manufacturing orders through native MRP workflows.\n"
msgstr ""

#. module: ff_batch_manufacturing
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ff_batch_manufacturing.field_ff_batch_manufacturing_line__manufacturing_state
msgid ""
" * Draft: The MO is not confirmed yet.\n"
" * Confirmed: The MO is confirmed, the stock rules and the reordering of the "
"components are trigerred.\n"
" * In Progress: The production has started (on the MO or on the WO).\n"
" * To Close: The production is done, the MO has to be closed.\n"
" * Done: The MO is closed, the stock moves are posted. \n"
" * Cancelled: The MO has been cancelled, can't be confirmed anymore."
msgstr ""

